  "finding": "CONTRADICTS psycle_codexfit.md and server/providers/codexfit.js leaveWaitlist(): the live site's leave call targets the waitlist ENTRY id returned by the join response (waitlist.id), not the event id. The doc and current code both assume DELETE /waitlists/{eventId}. Verified live 2026-09-26: joining event 217095 returned waitlist.id=300480, and leaving used DELETE /waitlists/300480 (200, {success:true}) — DELETE /waitlists/217095 was never called by the real site."
